      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有能让4只冰宝站上去的\nXL尺寸的冰岩怪吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
